245","like":2},{"handle":"mnscz133680","display_name":"LifeInsight","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2116501191672971264/ympRXbXK_400x400.jpg","text":"还没担心模型变差 先担心自己用不上了","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:18:17+08:00","url":"https://x.com/mnscz133680/status/2123043115925914030","like":1},{"handle":"Micro_Cosmos_X","display_name":"方寸万象","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2046321647792373760/N5lWKNlu_400x400.jpg","text":"明白着是羊毛党薅的，国内部分社区一进去就在说几十块钱的氢基米几乎无限用，一看是按jio/pixel/学生优惠算的价","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:32:28+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Micro_Cosmos_X/status/2123076884745629742","like":0},{"handle":"deathischain","display_name":"生为短锁","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1755053257658105856/7f3FtmZg_400x400.jpg","text":"这群司马东西，怪不得我的warp分流没法用了！！","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:02:25+08:00","url":"https://x.com/deathischain/status/2123069321085861965","like":0}]},"translated":false},{"id":"x-Gorden_Sun:2122998518000579052","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-Gorden_Sun","source_name":"Gorden Sun","title":"","summary":"Devin Bots：赛博外包公司 Devin专注的是软件开发领域，所以他推出的云端Bot也专注开发任务，比Grok Bot、Muse、Dots的云端开发效果好的多。 通过聊天说需求，主Agent就是包工头，他拉AI团队来干活，每个Bot独享一台云端虚拟机。AI直接群里沟通，像真人研发团队一样彼此沟通和派任务。 有软件工厂、性能优化师、安卓开发等现成的模板可以套用。 官方介绍：","body":"Devin Bots：赛博外包公司\n\nDevin专注的是软件开发领域，所以他推出的云端Bot也专注开发任务，比Grok Bot、Muse、Dots的云端开发效果好的多。\n\n通过聊天说需求，主Agent就是包工头，他拉AI团队来干活，每个Bot独享一台云端虚拟机。AI直接群里沟通，像真人研发团队一样彼此沟通和派任务。\n\n有软件工厂、性能优化师、安卓开发等现成的模板可以套用。\n\n官方介绍：","url":"https://x.com/Gorden_Sun/status/2122998518000579052","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-18T18:21:04+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T20:49:49+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"Gorden_Sun","display_name":"Gorden Sun","media":[],"quote":{"handle":"cognition","display_name":"Cognition","text":"Meet Devin Bots.\n\nFrom writing firmware to merging thousands of PRs a week, a Devin Bot leads a team of agents to get the job done.","url":"https://x.com/cognition/status/2122737511684587551","published_at":"2026-11-18T01:03:55+08:00"},"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1522159828231409664/GPpXyPT1_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":9,"view":2418,"like":8,"quote":0,"reply":5,"repost":2},"comments":[{"handle":"0x5668_nft","display_name":"mango是汪不是兔","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2121618354406555648/bwEey7nf_400x400.jpg","text":"包工头模式对了，单Bot扛不住活","published_at":"2026-11-19T00:00:12+08:00","url":"https://x.com/0x5668_nft/status/2123083864134557941","like":0},{"handle":"Curingieul","display_name":"Curing","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2086344763821973504/ShMBFO_B_400x400.jpg","text":"每个 Bot 独占一台云端 VM，好处是互不干扰，坏处是账单按小时跑。真拉一整个 AI 研发团队干一周，成本能比外包便宜多少？","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:56:40+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Curingieul/status/2123052774514438246","like":0},{"handle":"Lazy30512488561","display_name":"Lazy阿洋","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1769777184842088450/jvL2USzV_400x400.jpg","text":"这个“赛博外包公司”的比喻挺准，但分工好分，验收难收：Bot 并行干活、群里沟通都没问题，最后合并回去的代码质量谁兜底，才是它能不能进真实研发流程的关键。模板把上手门槛拉低了，验收和责任边界才是企业敢不敢用的分水岭。","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:38:19+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Lazy30512488561/status/2123048155608473910","like":0},{"handle":"mnscz133680","display_name":"LifeInsight","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2116501191672971264/ympRXbXK_400x400.jpg","text":"活能往下分了 最后验收可别又全堆回来","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:17:49+08:00","url":"https://x.com/mnscz133680/status/2123042999483675005","like":0},{"handle":"lzuren2001","display_name":"Laosun","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2106230531092627456/YgfakUvg_400x400.jpg","text":"每个Bot独占一台云端虚拟机这点挺关键，并行改代码不会互相踩。官方模板里有安卓开发，可以先拿小项目试","published_at":"2026-11-18T18:50:11+08:00","url":"https://x.com/lzuren2001/status/2123005846271701391","like":0}]},"translated":false},{"id":"x-Gorden_Sun:2122995483652088149","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-Gorden_Sun","source_name":"Gorden Sun","title":"","summary":"FastFrames：Apple开源的实时视频生成模型 包含1.3B和14B两个参数版本，能够在本地硬件上实时生成480p分辨率视频。 基于Wan2.1，两步自回归扩散蒸馏，单帧生成延迟压缩至35.4毫秒。此外，团队还同步放出了优化版的LingBot 1.3B模型，推理速度比官方原版提升16倍，支持流畅的镜头视角控制。 模型：","body":"FastFrames：Apple开源的实时视频生成模型\n\n包含1.3B和14B两个参数版本，能够在本地硬件上实时生成480p分辨率视频。\n\n基于Wan2.1，两步自回归扩散蒸馏，单帧生成延迟压缩至35.4毫秒。此外，团队还同步放出了优化版的LingBot 1.3B模型，推理速度比官方原版提升16倍，支持流畅的镜头视角控制。\n\n模型：","url":"https://x.com/Gorden_Sun/status/2122995483652088149","image":{"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2122995228915433472/img/OpwescU1X-pHLD7F.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080},"published_at":"2026-11-18T18:09:01+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T20:49:49+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"Gorden_Sun","display_name":"Gorden Sun","media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122995228915433472/vid/avc1/1920x1080/4kVzESz8CGz7zSPx.mp4","preview_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2122995228915433472/img/OpwescU1X-pHLD7F.jpg","duration_ms":104800}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1522159828231409664/GPpXyPT1_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":49,"view":5196,"like":42,"quote":0,"reply":13,"repost":3},"comments":[{"handle":"Curingieul","display_name":"Curing","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2086344763821973504/ShMBFO_B_400x400.jpg","text":"35.4ms 一帧差不多 28fps，本地跑 480p 实时视频这事儿算是真落地了。好奇 14B 版要多大显存，4090 能不能扛住？","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:31:43+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Curingieul/status/2123046496698532177","like":0},{"handle":"mnscz133680","display_name":"LifeInsight","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2116501191672971264/ympRXbXK_400x400.jpg","text":"能实时出画面再用键盘逛 已经有玩游戏那味了","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:17:38+08:00","url":"https://x.com/mnscz133680/status/2123042952993984513","like":0},{"handle":"alonzolab","display_name":"Call Me Alonzo","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2120517857582653441/MMuR1LOZ_400x400.jpg","text":"在本地硬件上 480p 单帧延迟压到约 35 毫秒步自回扩蒸这路是的。基已有视频模型做实时化，比从零堆大模型更适合端侧。不过实往往要在时一性节上做取舍，流不代复杂运动或字域也能稳住想知道镜头换或时，两蒸馏会不会出闪烁或结构移，以及更参数量的本主要补在哪类失上。","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:17:38+08:00","url":"https://x.com/alonzolab/status/2123042952503312573","like":0},{"handle":"0xSpeter","display_name":"0xspeter","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1876060080011096064/f7eP_N4-_400x400.jpg","text":"1.3B 版本能在本機即時跑 480p 才是亮點，想玩的先從小模型開始，14B 對顯卡要求應該不低。","published_at":"2026-11-18T19:56:00+08:00","url":"https://x.com/0xSpeter/status/2123022407304716662","like":0},{"handle":"FootballAnt247","display_name":"Leo 林晓｜AI视频","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2109931612217524224/S0Ai4T_e_400x400.jpg","text":"单帧35毫秒还能本地跑，实时出片这天比我想的来得早","published_at":"2026-11-18T19:39:17+08:00","url":"https://x.com/FootballAnt247/status/2123018199721730342","like":0},{"handle":"Sitju72Rsu11219","display_name":"doo","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2108066195400515584/IsxGfXUE_400x400.jpg","text":"镜头控制这个方向挺有意思。想看一个“转头再转回来”的测试：刚才离开画面的物体，回来时还在不在原位？能连续出帧是一关，能让人记住并探索同一个空间，又是另一关。","published_at":"2026-11-18T19:37:09+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Sitju72Rsu11219/status/2123017663274492047","like":0},{"handle":"auuutoo","display_name":"auuutoo","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1500730786273583104/72lofYLe_400x400.jpg","text":"项目页写了，这组延迟是在 NVIDIA B200 上测的\n\nS 模型一块卡 36 毫秒，仓库表里是 35.4 毫秒\n\nL 模型一块 B200 是 158 毫秒，8 块才到 45 毫秒\n\n安装要求是 Linux x86-64，驱动要兼容 CUDA 12.8","published_at":"2026-11-18T19:10:24+08:00","url":"https://x.com/auuutoo/status/2123010932624543963","like":0},{"handle":"LingBinshi","display_name":"良滨氏（一直是韭菜）","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2123013683500769280/V7tqOmn7_400x400.jpg","text":"单帧 35 毫秒、本地就能跑 480p 实时生成，做直播特效的人要开心了。14B 版本得多大显存才跑得动？","published_at":"2026-11-18T18:29:19+08:00","url":"https://x.com/LingBinshi/status/2123000594642448644","like":0}]},"translated":false},{"id":"x-Gorden_Sun:2122890872664773112","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-Gorden_Sun","source_name":"Gorden Sun","title":"","summary":"0人在意。 微软发布了7个模型。 MAI Code 2：日常开发，达到GPT-6.1 Sol 98%代码能力，价格约其40%； MAI Code 2 Flash：对标Luna和Haiku的快速模型； MAI Cyber 2 Flash：在CyberGymE2E安全基准测试中超过GPT-6 Astra，单任务成本不足后者的2%（刷分的，信都不要信） MAI Image 2.7：登顶Artificia…","body":"0人在意。\n\n微软发布了7个模型。\n\nMAI Code 2：日常开发，达到GPT-6.1 Sol 98%代码能力，价格约其40%；\n\nMAI Code 2 Flash：对标Luna和Haiku的快速模型；\n\nMAI Cyber 2 Flash：在CyberGymE2E安全基准测试中超过GPT-6 Astra，单任务成本不足后者的2%（刷分的，信都不要信）\n\nMAI Image 2.7：登顶Artificial Analysis图像编辑榜首，成本仅为GPT的五分之一（真的吗？我不信）\n\nMAI Transcribe 2：多语言语音转录模型。\n\nMAI Realtime 1：实时语音交互，每分钟低至0.01美元；\n\nDecision 1.1：决策模型\n\n官方介绍：https://t.co/biCadSekCn","url":"https://x.com/Gorden_Sun/status/2122890872664773112","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-18T11:13:20+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:31:16+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"Gorden_Sun","display_name":"Gorden Sun","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1522159828231409664/GPpXyPT1_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":41,"view":16108,"like":49,"quote":0,"reply":23,"repost":4},"comments":[{"handle":"hydra111222333","display_name":"hydra","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1311457076044992512/OrGcYXsz_400x400.jpg","text":"copilot 贵的一批 这个价格即便是百分之40 , 也是按api走token的 远比gpt plan 贵","published_at":"2026-11-18T20:54:38+08:00","url":"https://x.com/hydra111222333/status/2123037164137324653","like":7},{"handle":"ColinSeldon","display_name":"Colin","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2113490258163818496/NDwQ_GjQ_400x400.jpg","text":"Microsoft的网络产品是最令我疑惑的，无论国内IP还是国外IP都慢的离谱，我甚至能登陆Claude的节点有时都进不去ms的垃圾网站。完全没有任何使用和ms沾边的网络产品的兴趣。","published_at":"2026-11-18T22:16:43+08:00","url":"https://x.com/ColinSeldon/status/2123057818697867536","like":1},{"handle":"VoxVex000","display_name":"VoxVex❄️🪽🥾","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2116128463572873218/zfgi0L95_400x400.jpg","text":"从来不用","published_at":"2026-11-18T22:27:01+08:00","url":"https://x.com/VoxVex000/status/2123060414267449652","like":0},{"handle":"Pasakflx","display